  "description": "CR 603.2, 122.1, 608.2c, 701.21a, 701.23a, 702.29e: Last Light of Durin's Day takes a quest counter as each Mountain its controller controls enters, and at six is sacrificed to put a Dragon from hand and/or library onto the battlefield; it Mountaincycles",
